# Keep binary assets byte-identical through clone/checkout — without this a
# file git heuristically reads as text (a mostly-ASCII PDF, for instance) gets
# line-ending conversion applied and comes back corrupt.
*.pdf binary
*.epub binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.onnx binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.exe binary
*.bz2 binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
